                            "claim": "`format_message(user)` call duplicated across the email and sms branches `msg = format_message(user)` appears identically on line 3 (inside the `email` branch) and line 6 (inside the new `sms` branch) of `notify()`; the branches differ only in which `send_*` function is called. The message-construction step has no branch-specific behavior, so duplicating it only creates two places that must be kept in sync if `format_message` ever needs to vary by channel or gains new arguments \u2014 a future edit to one branch can silently drift from the other.",
